<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Viktor Orbán</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. <a href="/years/1963">1963</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Viktor Orbán is a Hungarian politician, a founder of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fidesz">Fidesz</a> party in 1988 and prime minister from 1998 to 2002 and again from 2010. His government used its two-thirds parliamentary majority to adopt a new constitution, the Fundamental Law of 2011, and his long dominance has shaped Hungarian politics in the 21st century.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/viktor-orban.jpg" alt="Viktor Orbán" width="320" height="418" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: The White House · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Viktor_Orban_2025_(cropped).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/szekesfehervar">Székesfehérvár</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/hungary">Hungary</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=47.19,18.41&amp;year=1998" aria-label="Székesfehérvár on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4981 508 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Viktor Orbán"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5431 778h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5431 778h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=47.19,18.41&amp;year=1998">What was here in 1998? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
